<li>An <strong>empty dependency array</strong> (<code>[]</code>) means the =
effect runs only once on mount.</li>
<li>Use <strong><code>useRef</code></strong> for mutable values that should=
n't cause re-renders.</li>
<li>Use <strong><code>useMemo</code></strong> or <strong><code>useCallback<=
/code></strong> to stabilize object/function references when they must be i=
n the dependency array.</li>
</ol>
